//www.espn.com/mlb/odds","text":"Odds"},{"rel":["odds","sportscenter","app","league"],"href":"sportscenter://x-callback-url/showClubhouse?uid=s:1~l:10&section=odds","text":"Odds"},{"rel":["playoff-bracket","desktop","league"],"href":"https://www.espn.com/mlb/playoff-bracket","text":"Bracket"},{"rel":["playoff-bracket","sportscenter","app","league"],"href":"sportscenter://x-callback-url/showClubhouse?uid=s:1~l:10&section=bracket","text":"Bracket"}],"logos":[{"href":"https://a.espncdn.com/i/teamlogos/leagues/500/mlb.png","rel":["full","default"]},{"href":"https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=/i/teamlogos/leagues/500-dark/mlb.png&w=500&h=500&transparent=true","rel":["full","dark"]}]}},"article":{"id":45413337,"nowId":"1-45413337","contentKey":"45413337-1-21-1","dataSourceIdentifier":"9fcc261a29dec","publishedkey":"mlb401695777","type":"Recap","gameId":"401695777","headline":"Muncy powers Dodgers with 7 RBIs in 18-2 rout of Yankees, LA's most runs ever vs New York","description":"— Max Muncy hit two three-run homers and tied his career high with seven RBI, helping the Los Angeles Dodgers rout Aaron Judge and the New York Yankees 18-2 on Saturday.","linkText":"Muncy powers Dodgers with 7 RBIs in 18-2 rout of Yankees, LA's most runs ever vs New York","categorized":"2025-07-23T01:27:41Z","originallyPosted":"2025-06-01T03:14:57Z","lastModified":"2025-06-01T03:14:55Z","published":"2025-06-01T03:14:57Z","section":"MLB","source":"AP","images":[{"type":"Media","name":"Max Muncy hits 2 HRs in big Dodgers' win","caption":"Max Muncy mashes two home runs to power the Dodgers to a blowout win over the Yankees.","height":324,"width":576,"url":"https://a.espncdn.com/media/motion/2025/0531/ss_20250531_222022453_2871591/ss_20250531_222022453_2871591.jpg"}],"video":[],"categories":[{"id":61,"type":"team","uid":"s:1~l:10~t:10","guid":"2b9cedf3-ce60-0bcf-fafe-8cd055255685","description":"New York Yankees","sportId":10,"teamId":10,"team":{"id":10,"description":"New York Yankees","abbreviation":"NYY","shortDisplayName":"Yankees","links":{"web":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/mlb/team/_/name/nyy/new-york-yankees"}},"mobile":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/mlb/team/_/name/nyy/new-york-yankees"}}}}},{"id":80311,"type":"league","uid":"s:1~l:10","guid":"b38f959b-7865-31ac-8841-b88355519e10","description":"MLB","sportId":10,"leagueId":10,"league":{"id":10,"description":"MLB","abbreviation":"MLB","links":{"web":{"leagues":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/mlb/"}},"mobile":{"leagues":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/mlb/"}}}}},{"id":694,"type":"team","uid":"s:1~l:10~t:19","guid":"fb7cf413-5156-9fc2-abe0-2273b89f70db","description":"Los Angeles Dodgers","sportId":10,"teamId":19,"team":{"id":19,"description":"Los Angeles Dodgers","abbreviation":"LAD","shortDisplayName":"Dodgers","links":{"web":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/mlb/team/_/name/lad/los-angeles-dodgers"}},"mobile":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/mlb/team/_/name/lad/los-angeles-dodgers"}}}}},{"type":"event","uid":"s:1~l:10~e:401695777","guid":"2d2490df-a4cd-3ce2-bba8-a81522d826f3","description":"New York Yankees @ Los Angeles Dodgers","eventId":401695777,"event":{"id":401695777,"sport":"baseball","league":"mlb","description":"New York Yankees @ Los Angeles Dodgers","links":{"web":{"event":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/mlb/game/_/gameId/401695777"}},"mobile":{"event":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/mlb/game/_/gameId/401695777"}}}}},{"type":"guid","guid":"2b9cedf3-ce60-0bcf-fafe-8cd055255685"},{"type":"guid","guid":"b38f959b-7865-31ac-8841-b88355519e10"},{"type":"guid","guid":"fb7cf413-5156-9fc2-abe0-2273b89f70db"},{"type":"guid","guid":"2d2490df-a4cd-3ce2-bba8-a81522d826f3"}],"keywords":["New York Yankees","MLB","Los Angeles Dodgers","New York Yankees @ Los Angeles Dodgers"],"story":"LOS ANGELES -- — <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/player/_/id/33303/max-muncy\">Max Muncy</a> hit two three-run homers and tied his career high with seven RBI, helping the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/team/_/name/lad/los-angeles-dodgers\">Los Angeles Dodgers</a> rout <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/player/_/id/33192/aaron-judge\">Aaron Judge</a> and the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/team/_/name/nyy/new-york-yankees\">New York Yankees</a> 18-2 on Saturday.\n\n\r\n              The Dodgers pounded out a season-high 21 hits and their runs were their most ever against the Yankees, whose only runs came on Judge’s 20th and 21st homers. Los Angeles set a record for runs by a National League team against the Yankees.\n\n\r\n              The Dodgers batted around in the first two innings, pummeling Yankees starter <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/player/_/id/5132011/will-warren\">Will Warren</a> (3-3). He needed 39 pitches in the first when the Dodgers led 4-0 on RBI singles by <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/player/_/id/31549/will-smith\">Will Smith</a> and Muncy, a sacrifice fly by <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/player/_/id/33711/michael-conforto\">Michael Conforto</a> and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/player/_/id/39907/tommy-edman\">Tommy Edman</a>'s RBI double.\n\n\r\n              Los Angeles was just getting started.\n\n\r\n              Muncy's 400-foot blast in the second was his 200th career homer and chased Warren. Edman had a RBI double and Kim followed with his second career homer, a 412-foot shot with two outs off <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/player/_/id/5116839/brent-headrick\">Brent Headrick</a> that made it 10-0. He and <a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/shohei-ohtani-pitching-dodgers-2dcea1beee37d10884d1b24df02a2710\"><a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/player/_/id/39832/shohei-ohtani\">Shohei Ohtani</a></a>, waiting to bat, bowed their heads to each other after Kim scored.\n\n\r\n              Muncy went deep off <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/player/_/id/36202/mark-leiter-jr\">Mark Leiter Jr</a>. with a 410-foot shot in the fifth and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/player/_/id/42468/andy-pages\">Andy Pages</a> added a solo shot in the seventh. Rookie <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/player/_/id/4619839/dalton-rushing\">Dalton Rushing</a> had his first major-league homer, a 3-run shot off position player <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/player/_/id/35439/pablo-reyes\">Pablo Reyes</a> in the eighth.\n\n\r\n              Dodgers starter <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/player/_/id/4417826/landon-knack\">Landon Knack</a> (3-2) allowed one run and five hits in six innings with six strikeouts. Position player Kiké Hernández finished off the blowout by allowing one hit in the ninth.\n\n\r\n              <hl2>Key moments</hl2>\r\n              Kim made a terrific play at shortstop in the third. Starting in place of injured <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/player/_/id/33039/mookie-betts\">Mookie Betts</a>, he caught <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/player/_/id/4722676/jorbit-vivas\">Jorbit Vivas</a>' liner and dived head-first to tag the bag, doubling <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/player/_/id/4683349/austin-wells\">Austin Wells</a> off second. The Dodgers successfully challenged the out call. In the seventh, Judge singled to center but was thrown out stretching to second on Pages' throw to Edman.\n\n\r\n              <hl2>Key stat</hl2>\r\n              The Dodgers have outscored the Yankees 26-7 in the first two games of their World Series rematch. They beat New York in five games last year for their eighth world championship.\n\n\r\n              <hl2>Up next</hl2>\r\n              Yankees LHP <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/player/_/id/33735/ryan-yarbrough\">Ryan Yarbrough</a> (2-0, 3.06 ERA) starts Sunday against Dodgers RHP <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mlb/player/_/id/4872587/yoshinobu-yamamoto\">Yoshinobu Yamamoto</a> (6-3, 1.97) in the series finale.\n\n\r\n              ------\n\n\r\n              AP MLB: <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/mlb\">https://apnews.com/hub/mlb</a>","premium":false,"isLiveBlog":false,"links":{"web":{"href":"http://www.espn.com/mlb/recap?gameId=401